     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I am quite new to secr and have just started using it for my project looking at leopard densities in the Eastern Cape (South Africa). Apart from a warning message for a small sample size during the closure test, all code appeared to be running fine until I compared all the created secr.fit files for the AIC values which returns the following:</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">                                   logLik     AIC    AICc dAICc AICcwt<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Unbaited30fit_null              -69.66038 145.321 169.321    NA     NA<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Unbaited30fit_b                 -68.85935 145.719      NA    NA     NA<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">Unbaited30fit_B                 -69.64212 147.284      NA    NA     NA<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"padding:0cm;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Unbaited30fit_elevation         -67.77163 143.543      NA    NA     NA<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"padding:0cm;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Unbaited30fit_lionpresence      -69.25413 146.508      NA    NA     NA<u></u><u></u></span></span></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"padding:0cm;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Unbaited30fit_bhpresence        -67.40179 142.804      NA    NA     NA</span></span></pre></pre>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">My code for the secr.fit analysis was as follows: </font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Unbaited30fit_null &lt;- secr.fit(Unbaited30, model = g~0, mask = MaskUnbaited30, method = &quot;Nelder-Mead&quot;)</font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I have tried variations without specifying the method or specifying different start values, all versions of the code run fine but none of them return a table with the full AIC values. </font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><br></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I have run similar analyses on two of my other data sets with very similar values, and those have gone through without any problems so am at a loss on any potential fixes I could try</font></pre><pre style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;backgro