     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div>Welcome to the group. <br></div><div>This is a problem specific to AICc with very small sample sizes (when the number of parameters is greater than or equal to the number of individuals). I expect it won&#39;t happen if you specify criterion = &#39;AIC&#39; in the AIC call (and AIC is probably a more reliable criterion in general). In any case, it would seem you have too few data for fancy models, and the likelihood differences are all negligible.</div><div>Murray<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
